dren":"Step 4 — Review the contract"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Before broadcasting, check the configuration one more time: name, symbol, supply, decimals and the controls you enabled. The on-chain values come from exactly what you review here — they cannot be changed after deployment. Our ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/docs#before-you-deploy","children":"pre-deployment checklist"}]," covers the full review."]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Step 5 — Deploy to BNB Smart Chain"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Confirm the transaction in your wallet. The network processes it, the network fee is paid in BNB, and your token’s contract is created on BNB Smart Chain. Follow the ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/how-it-works#after-deployment","children":"after-deployment walkthrough"}]," to view the contract on-chain, and verify its source on BscScan so anyone can inspect it."]}]]}]]}]}]
